      "Update goal reached and confirmed on 3 samples. The spec now places studio details by kind of screen moment, and all three samples place them the same way without per-app instructions. Home, index and collection screens get the bloom in the header band and a Caveat note on the lead that restates it: blog, catalog, overview, projects and team in samples s1 and s2, and the holdout docs home and landing hero too. The serif word appears only in h1s of 2 or more words on those screens, plus editorial titles. The featured item is taped and lifted. Settings screens get only a note--below on the section nav. Record-detail and product pages get no studio details. The page-level empty cart keeps its bloom, 1 tape strip and a note on its button. The holdouts work: the docs app and the landing page are recognizably the same system (docs-getting-started-installation, landing home).",
